xt","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「啊啊。正式见父母时可是不小的骚动呢。」","speaker":"父"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-5a6","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-5a6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"双亲的反应看来没什么问题。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-5d4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-5d4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我还一直在担心父母是不是因为加奈的事已经变得有些神经质了，看来是我多心了。也没看出母亲那自己儿子要被别的女人抢走了的嫉妒心。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-644","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-644"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……或许这就是所谓的人之父母吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-6c9","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6c9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「叔叔和阿姨那时是通过自由恋爱结婚的吗？」","speaker":"夕美"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-72d","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-72d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"夕美已经和家里人打成一片了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-75c","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-75c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"真是了不起的才能。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-799","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev48/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-799"},"allowed":["te